<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">P<span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">apers</span>P<span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">lease</span>: A Benchmark for Evaluating Motivational Values of 
